#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:5
msgid "General properties"
msgstr "常规属性"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:7
msgid ""
"The general properties section from `project properties`_ PopUP windows is "
"the area where the user can define global project variables that later on "
"can be used at the `folios title block templates`_ to automate the filling "
"of the `title block`_."
msgstr ""
"`项目属性 <project properties_>`_ 弹出窗口中的常规属性部分，是用户定义全局项目变量的区域，这些变量日后可在 `图幅图框模板 "
"<folios title block templates_>`_ 中使用，以自动填充 `图框 <title block_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:11
msgid ""
"Creating general project variables is recommended, it increases the working "
"efficiency. The variables that can be found by default are:"
msgstr "建议创建常规项目变量，这能提高工作效率。默认情况下可用的变量有："

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:14
msgid "**% {projecttitle}**: Project title"
msgstr "**% {projecttitle}** ：项目标题"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:15
msgid "**% {saveddate}**: File saving date"
msgstr "**% {saveddate}** ：文件保存日期"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:16
msgid "**% {savedfilename}**: Registered file name"
msgstr "**% {savedfilename}** ：已登记的文件名"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:17
msgid "**% {savedfilepath}**: Saved file path"
msgstr "**% {savedfilepath}** ：已保存的文件路径"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:18
msgid "**% {savedtime}**: File saving time"
msgstr "**% {savedtime}** ：文件保存时间"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:23
msgid "Figure: General project properties window"
msgstr "图：常规项目属性窗口"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:25
msgid "To create a new project variable:"
msgstr "要创建新的项目变量："

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:27
msgid "`Display project properties`_ PopUp window."
msgstr "`显示项目属性 <Display project properties_>`_ 弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:28
msgid "Go to **General** project properties section."
msgstr "转到 **常规** 项目属性部分。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:29
msgid ""
"Define the variable name at the left cell from the last row of the project "
"variables table."
msgstr "在项目变量表格最后一行的左侧单元格中定义变量名称。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:30
msgid ""
"Define the value of the variable at the right cell from the variable row."
msgstr "在变量行右侧的单元格中定义变量的值。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:31
msgid ""
"Press the button **OK** to save the changes and close the PopUp window."
msgstr "按下 **OK** 按钮以保存更改并关闭弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/general_prop.rst:35
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech default variables, refer to `default"
" QElectroTech variables`_ section."
msgstr ""
"有关 QElectroTech 默认变量的更多信息，请参阅 `默认 QElectroTech 变量 <default QElectroTech "
"variables_>`_ 一节。"
